      "text": "请求示例\nPOST /api/games-background-assets-service/v1/open-gw/dev/12***3344/package-file/apply HTTP/1.1\nHost: connect-api.cloud.huawei.com\nclient_id: 41*****7168\nAuthorization: Bearer ******\nrequestId: *****\n{\n    \"appId\": \"12345678\",\n    \"versionId\": 99,\n    \"fileName\": \"Demo\",\n    \"fileSHA256\": \"06***d762\",\n    \"fileLength\": 100,\n    \"fileType\": 127,\n    \"filePartApplyInfo\": [\n      {\n        \"partNo\": \"23\",\n        \"fileSHA256\": \"06***d762\",\n        \"fileLength\": 100\n      }\n    ]\n  }"
    },
    {
      "section": "响应示例",
